{"title":"What should I ask Joanne Paul?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/935014814/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-Joanne-Paul.html","date":1765962162000,"content":"<p>Yes I will be doing a Conversation with her.  From the Google internet:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>Joanne Paul is a writer, broadcaster, consultant, and Honorary Senior Lecturer in Intellectual History at the University of Sussex. A BBC/AHRC New Generation Thinker, her research focuses on the intellectual and cultural history of the Renaissance and Early Modern periods…</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>She has a new book out <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Thomas-More-Life-Joanne-Paul/dp/1639368795/ref=sr_1_1?crid=DSDRQKTNUXV1&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.hJfn5k20YohoLvzIkPy448566tssLamjnstyB-KJvoetti9QFc6p5FRLQ2s2CcvXJNSjmj4yEDgDvdTZoaXgaFfXoJec-uOaYYK4gSRr1lGmRnEkP00EtjdqnW-t02sWXu99LqS7SB6-KPzQh4lokxYSKPksboCoSonZ-fzhQeiC8g0ZKNskT9CJF38V-K3AhnBxBSZuxKHdEwE1j4BuM3Mchc7vfFcHLa4KVACWLvE.mdQAsMCrtXdqefR0dJkopG59ZUCSnYH89ox1kYOAPGU&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=joanne+paul&amp;qid=1765904635&amp;sprefix=joanne+paul%2Caps%2C323&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Thomas More: A Life</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://joannepaul.com/\" target=\"_blank\">her home page</a>.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/Joanne_Paul_\" target=\"_blank\">Joanne on Twitter</a>.  She has <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv=7d70a82f3a9a6d6b&amp;udm=7&amp;fbs=AIIjpHxU7SXXniUZfeShr2fp4giZ1Y6MJ25_tmWITc7uy4KIeuYzzFkfneXafNx6OMdA4MQRJc_t_TQjwHYrzlkIauOKMEMMjGxxQXSkjMjijTcGcEuw4RddZrfTQ0sWOcWVg7gUEXeINIcxAVFUUrLbk2x97uqT37YGrKQWfslVMLW6RLlCTxDjPfS7NO4cm0Jm4TqaY6arEz-Z_SxUjfkHXWEu85d_0g&amp;q=joanne+paul&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwi7gJTaysKRAxWyBdsEHfXDG1wQtKgLegQIIRAB&amp;biw=1280&amp;bih=585&amp;dpr=1.5\" target=\"_blank\">many videos on the Tudor period</a>, some with over one million views.</p>\r\n<p>So what should I ask her?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/what-should-i-ask-joanne-paul.html\">What should I ask Joanne Paul?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/935014814/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/935014814/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/935014814/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/935014814/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/935014814/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/935014814/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/what-should-i-ask-joanne-paul.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/what-should-i-ask-joanne-paul.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/what-should-i-ask-joanne-paul.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/what-should-i-ask-joanne-paul.html#comment-